I’ve been using discord for years. I love discord and it’s my main way of messaging. I love the original layout. My only complaint was that there wasn’t a good purple option for nitro themes. And I certainly had no issues with the original mobile version. This new update is trying a bit too hard to look fancy and I really just don’t like it. Not everything has to have round bubble boxes. Changing the channel symbol to be ‘Aa’ instead of ‘#’ is so weird. At least change it to another symbol like ‘-‘. Not letters. The swipe left to reply is so annoying and I can’t for the life of me figure out how to view the online members. It’s way too different, it hurts my head, I don’t like it.

It’s so much less streamline now and it’s just- eugh. I know companies rarely revert an update, especially one as large as this, but I really want the old one back. It was easier to look at, it was nice and streamline, it was simple. This is way too bubbly, it’s trying too hard, and it just doesn’t look like discord anymore. Opening discord makes me anxious now and *please* at *least* give us the option to have this version or the old one, I am begging you 🙏

It’s so different and hard on the neurodivergent brain ;-;

Hey I’ve been using Discord since I have been a kid I’m now Admin/Mod in servers and Own a couple servers I do my best using my phone but all features well most helpful features are only on the website version or desktop version it’s hard to maintain a server without the helpful feature!

Could yous try make a couple apps to help discord server owners and users and make a App for:

(1) App for Discord Bots {there is one but not from the official discord owners}

(2) App for Discord Servers {again there is one but not by discord owners and is barley helpful}

(3) App for Discord Apps {apps that can be linked or added to your server like the website feature [ITS PRE MUCH DISCORD DICTIONARY]}

This 3 apps would make Discord so much better and useful and would help so many users please read this and tryyyy!!!!!🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽‼️‼️‼️
